index e45aa10..1edde91 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -70,8 +70,15 @@ function emitted() {
 EE.once('event-name', emitted, context);
 EE.on('another-event', emitted, context);
 EE.removeListener('another-event', emitted, context);
+EE.removeListenersByContext(context); // returns the number removed
 ```
 
+`EventEmitter.removeListenersByContext(context)` removes every listener whose
+stored invocation context is strictly equal to `context`, across all events.
+Duplicate and one-time listeners are counted separately. As with `on` and
+`once`, an omitted or falsy context is normalized to the emitter itself, so
+those listeners can be removed with `EE.removeListenersByContext(EE)`.
+
 ### Tests and benchmarks
 
 To run tests run `npm test`. To run the benchmarks run `npm run benchmark`.
